ist between the response and the visual evidence.\n\n## Conclusion\nBoth parts of the task were completed: a parking area in Salem (Museum Place Garage) was located, and a route from it to Marblehead was generated with the route visualized on the map and detailed turn-by-turn directions displayed.\n\n**Verdict: SUCCESS**",
